        "3. Inspect per-channel ZQCal PU/PD codes and MRC training pass/fail per byte lane across FSP/PF states.",
        "4. Compare 2D eye margins (1D/2D eye-margin shmoo) at room vs hot (85 °C+ refresh/leakage) and cold (drive strength/training)."
