            "text": "Skip lspci -vv and PERST#/REFCLK scope checks and reflash the GPU VBIOS immediately on Detect fails.",
            "correct": false,
            "explain": "PCIe Detect/Polling fails happen before software drivers ever touch BARs—missing 100 MHz REFCLK, early PERST# deassertion, or open TX AC-coupling caps cause L0 failures even with golden VBIOS."
