        "3. Assert edge cases (`VisaIOError`, NaN strings, finally PSU shutoff on crash) using `pytest` before deploying to benches.",
        "4. Run an explicit mocked vs hardware-in-loop tag so offline test reports never impersonate real silicon passes."
