        "pseudo": "// Check hard Vmin/Vmax spec -> compute median & MAD -> flag |0.6745*(x-med)/MAD| > 3.5",
        "code": "import statistics\n\ndef find_outliers(vals, lo=0.75, hi=0.95, thresh=3.5):\n    med = statistics.median(vals)\n    mad = statistics.median(abs(v - med) for v in vals)\n    scale = 1.4826 * mad                               # consistent std estimate under normality\n    flagged = []\n    for idx, v in enumerate(vals):\n        z = abs(v - med) / scale if scale > 0 else 0.0\n        if not (lo <= v <= hi) or z > thresh:\n            flagged.append((idx, v, round(z, 2)))\n    return flagged\n"
